      "content": "rest doesnt really help though. i rest, i try to be better, and then i just wake up and it's the same mess. it's not just being tired, it's like the whole concept of trying is pointless. it feels like i'm just prolonging something that's already broken. like, if i'm just gonna keep failing over and over, what's the point of the struggle?",
