      "content": "accepting it? that just sounds like a slower way to suffer. i dont want to just sit here and watch myself fail for another ten years. i just want it to stop. the cycle, the guilt, the constant heaviness... i just want an actual end to it. is there even a way out that isn't just more of this?",
